        "original_id": "3ddd447c-f0a1-58b1-9b66-d939d79676f8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jodie Foster, Alan Di Fiore, Jim Kouf, Jamie Linden, Giancarlo Esposito, Olivia Luccardi, Juno Temple, Julia Garner, Alessandro Nivola, Maggie Siff, Philip Ettinger\n- Products: Money Monster, Breaking Bad, Better Call Saul, It Follows, The Rewrite, One Percent More Humid\n- Awards: Critics' Choice Television Awards, Primetime Emmy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Giancarlo Esposito was born on April 26, 1958, and he is an American actor.\n- In 2012, Giancarlo Esposito won the Best Supporting Actor in a Drama award at the Critics' Choice Television Awards for playing Gustavo \"Gus\" Fring on Breaking Bad and Better Call Saul.\n- In 2012, Giancarlo Esposito was nominated for the Outstanding Supporting Actor in a Drama Series award at the Primetime Emmy Awards for playing Gustavo \"Gus\" Fring on Breaking Bad and Better Call Saul.\n- Money Monster is a 2016 American thriller film directed by Jodie Foster and written by Alan Di Fiore, Jim Kouf, and Jamie Linden.\n- Olivia Luccardi is best known for playing Yara in It Follows, Chloe in The Rewrite, and Arlene in Money Monster.\n- One Percent More Humid stars Juno Temple, Julia Garner, Alessandro Nivola, Maggie Siff, Olivia Luccardi, and Philip Ettinger.",
